    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Tips</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game may take a longer time to start up for the first time. Please be patient.\u00a0If you have any problems while playing the game, please contact us: <a href=\"mailto:sicrystalstudio@126.com\">sicrystalstudio@126.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 It is said that in the distant Eastern continent, there is a young man named GUILING who is known for his chivalrous and righteous deeds, as well as his ability to punish and eliminate evil, and is deeply loved by people. One day, evil forces reached out to Dr.Wu's factory, and this evil forces killed the workers and turned the surviving people into cursed zombies. This time, GUILING will set off again to investigate this cursed land. Can he defeat this evil force? Who is the true evil force? Is Dr. Wu the biggest demon? Players will play as the hero GUILING of the mysterious Eastern continent and engage in a life and death battle with demons, searching for ways to break curses, repel zombies, and seal evil spirits. Can we fight against evil forces and escape from the cursed land this time? The wheel of destiny is in your control......The game integrates various gameplay such as decryption, shooting, and physical sandbox, taking you to find the secrets behind the hidden dark world and face up evil spirits much closer! Experience an epic hero journey, feel the fantastic horror and exceptionally interesting gameplay!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 It is said that in the distant Eastern continent, there is a young man named GUILING who is known for his chivalrous and righteous deeds, as well as his ability to punish and eliminate evil, and is deeply loved by people. One day, evil forces reached out to Dr.Wu's factory, and this evil forces killed the workers and turned the surviving people into cursed zombies. This time, GUILING will set off again to investigate this cursed land. Can he defeat this evil force? Who is the true evil force? Is Dr. Wu the biggest demon? Players will play as the hero GUILING of the mysterious Eastern continent and engage in a life and death battle with demons, searching for ways to break curses, repel zombies, and seal evil spirits. Can we fight against evil forces and escape from the cursed land this time? The wheel of destiny is in your control......The game integrates various gameplay such as decryption, shooting, and physical sandbox, taking you to find the secrets behind the hidden dark world and face up evil spirits much closer! Experience an epic hero journey, feel the fantastic horror and exceptionally interesting gameplay!</p>",
    "short_description": "An action oriented shooting horror game, where players will be the hero GUILING from mysterious Eastern continent and engage in battles with demons to find ways to break curses, defeat zombies, and seal evil spirits. Can we fight against evil forces and escape from the cursed land?",
